# 3️⃣ MONEY VELOCITY

(*How fast the money circulates after the movie*)

This is where your model can actually stand out. Most economists stop before this because it’s messy.

But this is where truth lives.

---

## 🔁 A. First-order circulation

Money earned → immediate spending

Examples:

* Crew spends salary on rent, food, travel
* Actors invest or spend
* Vendors reinvest in new projects

