If you presented this as:

> “Expenditure-based direct footprint: ₹4,772 crore.
> Independently estimated income-side footprint: ₹4,354 crore.
> Discrepancy: ₹419 crore, or 8.8%, due to incomplete public information on wage distribution, producer realization, tax treatment, and rights geography.
> Secondary local spillover: ₹320 crore.”

…that would sound like someone doing serious reconstruction under uncertainty, not someone laundering vibes through LaTeX.

